    "discipline": "Chemical",
    "subject": "Fluid Mechanics",
    "chapter": "Flow Measurement",
    "topic": "Orifice",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n    <div class=\"col-8\">\r\n   <div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$Q = CA_0 \\sqrt{2g \\left(\\dfrac{P_1}{\\gamma} + z_1 - \\dfrac{P_2}{\\gamma} -z_2\\right)}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 196</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$C = \\dfrac{C_V C_C}{\\sqrt{1 - (C_C)^2\\left(\\dfrac{A_0}{A_1}\\right)^2}}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 196</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/Orifice_plate.jpg\" style=\"width:340px;\"></p>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Orifice_plate.jpg\">Bitjungle</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\nVolumetric Flow through Orifice Discharging Freely into Atmosphere is given by:\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$Q= CA_0 \\sqrt{2gh}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 186</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nTime required to drain a tank:\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\Delta t = \\dfrac{2\\left(\\dfrac{A_t}{A_0}\\right)}{\\sqrt{2}g} \\left( h_1^{1/2} - h_2^{1/2}\\right) $ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 186</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
    "important": "Volumetric Flow through Orifice\r\n\\[Q= CA_0 \\sqrt{2gh}\\]\r\n\r\nTime required to drain a tank:\r\n\\[\\Delta t = \\dfrac{2\\left(\\dfrac{A_t}{A_0}\\right)}{\\sqrt{2}g} \\left( h_1^{1/2} - h_2^{1/2}\\right)\\]",
