    "content_html": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col-8\">\r\n\r\n<p>Absorption is the  movement of a drug from its site of administration to the systemic circulation by crossing biological membrane.</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/Simplified_absorption_column.png\" alt=\"Simplified absorption column\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Simplified_absorption_column.png\">Jocelynskim</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons<br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
