    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n    <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   <p>Membrane processes involve the separation, purification, and concentration of components in a fluid mixture using semi-permeable membranes. Membrane processes are used in a wide range of applications, including water treatment, desalination, pharmaceutical manufacturing, food and beverage production, and the petrochemical industry.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/26/Membrane_Capacitive_Deionization_in_work.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Membrane_Capacitive_Deionization_in_work.jpg\">Ranzhao</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0\">CC BY 3.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
