    "topic": "Cost Indices",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "Some sample cost indices for Chemical Engineering are:\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Chemical Engineering Index</li>\r\n<li>Marshall and Swift Cost Index</li>\r\n<li>Intratec Chemical Plant Construction Index</li>\r\n<li>Nelson-Farrar Indexes</li>\r\n</ol>",
    "important": "",
